    "matcher": "Qwen matchers accept the Claude aliases exactly (Bash/Shell to run_shell_command, Edit to edit, Write to write_file, NotebookEdit to notebook_edit, Monitor to monitor), so the hooks fire. PowerShell and MultiEdit have no alias and match nothing (skeptic verdict hook_pre_tool (a))."
